    "78174f2331fecdeb698f366987db08e6c0ad3d23": {
      "message": "chore(repo): register dsh-github in release tooling, CI and docs\n\n- scripts/packages.mjs: the package joins the list both release scripts\n  and the branch gate read, so a new plugin cannot escape check-release.\n- scripts/check-release.test.mjs: the fixture now commits and tags a\n  fourth package, keeping the passing case honest about the list.\n- publish.yml: dsh-github-v* tags resolve to the dsh-github directory.\n- README.md and AGENTS.md: the plugin table, install pin, directory tree\n  and the build-artifact rules name the new package.",
      "author": {
